{"version":1,"content":"<p>朝中社今（3日）報道，朝鮮導彈總局昨日（2日）進行了戰略巡航導彈散佈戰鬥部（集束彈頭）威力評估試驗和垂直打擊飛行特性試驗。</p><p>報道提到朝鮮導彈總局戰鬥研究所公布試驗結果，聲稱巡航導彈可將5至6公頃目標地區「夷為平地」。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-03T03:21:36.349282+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":108,"images":0,"source":"明報 國際","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-03T02:50:55+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-04T08:18:22.629429+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-03T03:18:33.347888+00:00","content_hash":"da2fd564bfa1525503fe209adb43a80a96b8b746dbcf14645dc374549e877501","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}